    "title": "Suspect sought after woman attacked with hammer at Poway home - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Natanya Faitelson ,\n23 hours ago The San Diego County Sheriff's Department was looking for a man suspected of assaulting a woman with a hammer at a home in Poway Tuesday. The San Diego County Sheriff's Office was investigating the incident as a domestic assault that occurred around 3 a.m. Tuesday on the 14100 block of Brighton Avenue, according to a Sheriff's Department spokesperson. Read full article\n2",
